WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:05.570 --> 00:00:07.830
In August 2020, while Europe was

00:00:07.830 --> 00:00:11.597
on the cusp of a devastating
second wave of Covid-19,

00:00:11.597 --> 00:00:13.780
and the U.S. was struggling to find beds

00:00:13.780 --> 00:00:16.100
for its sickest patients with the virus,

00:00:16.100 --> 00:00:17.947
this was happening in Russia.

00:00:29.080 --> 00:00:31.313
But the rest of the world wasn't so sure.

00:00:33.100 --> 00:00:35.200
Russia has become the first country to

00:00:35.200 --> 00:00:39.200
give regulatory approval
to a Covid-19 vaccine.

00:00:39.200 --> 00:00:41.360
But there are myriad questions

00:00:41.360 --> 00:00:44.630
and concerns already. A vaccine so quickly

00:00:44.630 --> 00:00:48.563
and from a country notorious
for propaganda and deception.

00:00:50.820 --> 00:00:54.760
The issue is not about the
science of the vaccine.

00:00:54.760 --> 00:00:57.260
It's about the approach that was used

00:00:57.260 --> 00:01:00.480
by the Russian government,
in terms of approving

00:01:00.480 --> 00:01:05.050
and starting to use the
vaccine before the phase three

00:01:05.050 --> 00:01:07.853
clinical trial data was in.

00:01:07.853 --> 00:01:09.350
Starting to use the vaccine,

00:01:09.350 --> 00:01:12.050
starting to try to export the vaccine

00:01:12.050 --> 00:01:15.660
and launching this entire
propaganda campaign

00:01:15.660 --> 00:01:19.123
actually worked against the product.

00:01:20.100 --> 00:01:21.600
After first facing scrutiny

00:01:21.600 --> 00:01:24.340
on whether Russia's
vaccines actually work,

00:01:24.340 --> 00:01:25.731
now the question has become

00:01:25.731 --> 00:01:29.170
whether they can meet worldwide demand.

00:01:29.170 --> 00:01:30.570
Critics and observers

00:01:30.570 --> 00:01:33.510
are now left wondering is
the Kremlin playing vaccine

00:01:33.510 --> 00:01:36.830
politics as part of a campaign
to undercut Western powers

00:01:36.830 --> 00:01:37.913
and their technology?

00:01:38.770 --> 00:01:41.900
Or is this a case of solid
science being tainted

00:01:41.900 --> 00:01:44.710
by allegations of Russian
hacking, poisonings

00:01:44.710 --> 00:01:47.020
and interference in democratic elections.

00:01:57.200 --> 00:01:58.340
Russia's scrambling

00:01:58.340 --> 00:02:00.780
to bring Covid-19 under control.

00:02:00.780 --> 00:02:04.220
Russia is battling a surge in Covid cases.

00:02:04.220 --> 00:02:05.610
The virus came late to Russia,

00:02:05.610 --> 00:02:08.270
but it is definitely here now.

00:02:08.270 --> 00:02:11.170
Russia reported its first Covid-19 cases

00:02:11.170 --> 00:02:14.900
in January in Siberia
and Russia's far East.

00:02:14.900 --> 00:02:19.540
By July, officials reported
almost 840,000 cases.

00:02:19.540 --> 00:02:21.993
And more than 30,000 excessive deaths.

00:02:22.870 --> 00:02:24.630
Global health experts however,

00:02:24.630 --> 00:02:27.560
have questioned the
accuracy of Russia's data,

00:02:27.560 --> 00:02:30.130
deeming the number of
Covid related fatalities

00:02:30.130 --> 00:02:32.660
too low given infection rates.

00:02:32.660 --> 00:02:35.410
Russia acted very swiftly
to impose restrictions.

00:02:35.410 --> 00:02:40.280
It was one of the first
countries to enact a total ban

00:02:40.280 --> 00:02:41.990
on the entry of Chinese citizens.

00:02:41.990 --> 00:02:46.990
And by late March, it had
imposed a shutdown of its borders

00:02:47.100 --> 00:02:50.473
and a series of lockdowns
across the country.

00:02:51.720 --> 00:02:53.170
Meanwhile, in Moscow,

00:02:53.170 --> 00:02:55.030
the Gamaleya Research Institute

00:02:55.030 --> 00:02:58.040
of Epidemiology and Microbiology named

00:02:58.040 --> 00:03:00.047
after pioneering Russian
vaccine researcher

00:03:00.047 --> 00:03:02.811
Nikolay Gamaleya got to work.

00:03:05.310 --> 00:03:07.693
They called the project Sputnik V.

00:03:13.352 --> 00:03:17.750
Sputnik V is a reference
to a very important date

00:03:17.750 --> 00:03:20.570
in Soviet history, which was the launch

00:03:20.570 --> 00:03:25.440
of the world's first
satellite, Sputnik, in 1957

00:03:25.440 --> 00:03:28.210
and that marked the
start of the Space Race

00:03:28.210 --> 00:03:31.900
between the Soviet Union
and the United States.

00:03:31.900 --> 00:03:34.510
In naming it after that, it's clear

00:03:34.510 --> 00:03:39.120
that Russia was positioning
itself as a player in a

00:03:39.120 --> 00:03:40.840
geopolitical struggle.

00:03:40.840 --> 00:03:43.420
The first artificial Earth satellite,

00:03:43.420 --> 00:03:45.073
a world-stirring event.

00:03:48.070 --> 00:03:50.450
By May, the Gamaleya Institute had already

00:03:50.450 --> 00:03:53.510
started testing their vaccine
on the center's director

00:03:53.510 --> 00:03:55.310
as well as key scientific staff.

00:03:55.310 --> 00:03:57.480
A move which seemed to place Russia ahead

00:03:57.480 --> 00:03:59.560
of other countries in the vaccine race.

00:03:59.560 --> 00:04:02.420
The institute supplied vaccines

00:04:02.420 --> 00:04:04.911
for use against the Ebola outbreak

00:04:04.911 --> 00:04:08.778
in Guinea in 2017 to 2018.

00:04:08.778 --> 00:04:10.675
The Covid-19 vaccine

00:04:10.675 --> 00:04:14.450
that they developed
was based on technology

00:04:14.450 --> 00:04:18.580
they had earlier applied in
an experimental inoculation

00:04:18.580 --> 00:04:22.480
against the deadly Middle
East Respiratory Syndrome

00:04:22.480 --> 00:04:23.680
or MERS.

00:04:23.680 --> 00:04:26.710
And that's what allowed Russia to go ahead

00:04:26.710 --> 00:04:30.403
relatively quickly in
developing a Covid-19 vaccine.

00:04:39.610 --> 00:04:40.880
But on August 11th,

00:04:40.880 --> 00:04:42.440
when President Putin announced

00:04:42.440 --> 00:04:44.000
that Sputnik had been registered

00:04:44.000 --> 00:04:46.750
as the world's first Covid-19 vaccine,

00:04:46.750 --> 00:04:49.780
it hadn't started vital
phase three trials,

00:04:49.780 --> 00:04:52.310
prompting worry among
the scientific community

00:04:52.310 --> 00:04:54.613
and mockery from the Trump administration.

00:05:01.800 --> 00:05:04.130
I was extraordinarily surprised

00:05:04.130 --> 00:05:06.810
to see that announcement in August.

00:05:06.810 --> 00:05:09.040
I'm not surprised that
they were working on it,

00:05:09.040 --> 00:05:11.210
not surprised they started
the clinical trials,

00:05:11.210 --> 00:05:14.693
but very surprised and
a little bit disturbed

00:05:14.693 --> 00:05:17.940
to see them starting to use
it before they had the data.

00:05:17.940 --> 00:05:20.910
For Putin it was clearly very important

00:05:20.910 --> 00:05:22.670
to be first in the world

00:05:22.670 --> 00:05:26.269
to release and approve a vaccine.

00:05:26.269 --> 00:05:31.269
And so the entire state
propaganda apparatus

00:05:31.269 --> 00:05:32.832
worked overtime

00:05:32.832 --> 00:05:37.090
to present this as a huge
victory for Russian science,

00:05:37.090 --> 00:05:41.820
for the Russian pharma
industry and basically as proof

00:05:41.820 --> 00:05:46.510
of Russia's superiority
in areas where the country

00:05:46.510 --> 00:05:48.307
has long been written off.

00:05:52.602 --> 00:05:55.030
Isn't it premature for Russia to

00:05:55.030 --> 00:05:58.590
have approved this vaccine
before phase three trials

00:05:58.590 --> 00:06:00.810
are substantially underway?

00:06:00.810 --> 00:06:01.870
No, not at all.

00:06:01.870 --> 00:06:04.039
First we were criticized
but then we saw that

00:06:04.039 --> 00:06:06.450
Britain announced that
they may follow suit.

00:06:06.450 --> 00:06:08.160
U.S. FDA said that they may want

00:06:08.160 --> 00:06:09.601
to register before phase three.

00:06:10.777 --> 00:06:14.810
The suspicion that this is
a propaganda tool rather

00:06:14.810 --> 00:06:19.710
than actually a way to fight
Covid-19 was obviously there

00:06:19.710 --> 00:06:22.000
and it was expectable that reaction.

00:06:22.000 --> 00:06:24.700
The Putin government has
done a lot of ugly things

00:06:24.700 --> 00:06:29.240
to earn the suspicion and
distrust of especially

00:06:29.240 --> 00:06:30.250
Western nations.

00:06:30.250 --> 00:06:34.380
So obviously there was a
certain handicap to overcome

00:06:34.380 --> 00:06:39.310
and that could not be done
with premature fanfare.

00:06:39.310 --> 00:06:42.550
It could only be counteracted
with scientific proof

00:06:42.550 --> 00:06:45.253
and scientific proof was
eventually delivered.

00:06:46.230 --> 00:06:47.420
On February 2nd,

00:06:47.420 --> 00:06:50.160
in the esteemed medical
journal The Lancet,

00:06:50.160 --> 00:06:53.620
vaccine experts, professors,
Polly Roy and Ian Jones

00:06:53.620 --> 00:06:56.360
reported that Sputnik V appeared safe

00:06:56.360 --> 00:06:59.523
with an efficacy rate of 91.6%.

00:07:04.200 --> 00:07:08.110
This was really a chance
for Russia to dispel a lot

00:07:08.110 --> 00:07:12.800
of the skepticism surrounding
the vaccine and you know

00:07:12.800 --> 00:07:16.823
whether it was actually
good at combating Covid-19.

00:07:18.030 --> 00:07:21.740
I think it's fair to say that
demand increased as a result

00:07:21.740 --> 00:07:24.420
of that breakthrough.

00:07:24.420 --> 00:07:27.790
In Europe, there has definitely
been a change of sentiment.

00:07:27.790 --> 00:07:31.050
There are shortages of
the vaccine in Europe.

00:07:31.050 --> 00:07:36.030
So, you know, now the EU
is looking at a request to

00:07:36.030 --> 00:07:39.370
approve the use of Sputnik V.

00:07:39.370 --> 00:07:44.200
In addition to that several
European countries, France

00:07:44.200 --> 00:07:48.430
Germany, Spain and Italy
may also manufacture it.

00:07:48.430 --> 00:07:50.330
So it's definitely fair to say

00:07:50.330 --> 00:07:51.980
that there was a change of heart.

00:08:08.920 --> 00:08:13.840
Sputnik is very similar to
both the AstraZeneca vaccine

00:08:13.840 --> 00:08:17.300
and the Johnson and Johnson
vaccine in that it's

00:08:17.300 --> 00:08:20.500
an adenovirus vectored vaccine.

00:08:20.500 --> 00:08:25.500
And what that means is that
they're using a common cold

00:08:25.502 --> 00:08:29.010
virus to deliver a little bit

00:08:29.010 --> 00:08:31.101
of the Covid virus

00:08:31.101 --> 00:08:34.250
to your own cells and
sort of tricks your cells

00:08:34.250 --> 00:08:38.990
into making just a little
bit of the Covid virus.

00:08:38.990 --> 00:08:42.560
And with that little bit,
which is the spike protein

00:08:42.560 --> 00:08:45.280
your body's able to
mount an immune response

00:08:45.280 --> 00:08:49.010
so you develop T-cells,
you develop antibodies

00:08:49.010 --> 00:08:52.300
that all respond to Covid-19

00:08:52.300 --> 00:08:55.360
if you should get infected in the future.

00:08:55.360 --> 00:08:58.490
Sputnik V is also double
vectored, which means

00:08:58.490 --> 00:09:00.760
that it uses a slightly different version

00:09:00.760 --> 00:09:02.600
of the vaccine in the second dose.

00:09:02.600 --> 00:09:06.670
So protection against
Covid-19 could last longer.

00:09:06.670 --> 00:09:09.020
I don't necessarily think that in terms

00:09:09.020 --> 00:09:11.810
of the vaccine itself and
how it works in the body

00:09:11.810 --> 00:09:15.400
it exhibits any advantages
over the mRNA system.

00:09:15.400 --> 00:09:19.890
Now vaccines like
Sputnik, like AstraZeneca

00:09:19.890 --> 00:09:21.820
and like the Johnson and Johnson vaccine

00:09:21.820 --> 00:09:24.350
that are all adenovirus vector vaccines

00:09:24.350 --> 00:09:28.350
are much more stable
in warmer temperatures.

00:09:28.350 --> 00:09:31.470
And so that makes this
cold-chain much easier.

00:09:31.470 --> 00:09:34.730
That means the storage and the
distribution is much easier.

00:09:34.730 --> 00:09:39.210
And so all of that is a
real positive strength.

00:09:39.210 --> 00:09:41.820
The AstraZeneca and
Johnson and Johnson shots

00:09:41.820 --> 00:09:45.110
have in rare cases, been
connected to blood clots.

00:09:45.110 --> 00:09:47.680
Russian officials claim that
Sputnik though developed

00:09:47.680 --> 00:09:51.330
in the same way hasn't
caused similar side effects.

00:09:51.330 --> 00:09:52.500
All of this combined

00:09:52.500 --> 00:09:55.960
with a relatively low
production cost of $10 a dose,

00:09:55.960 --> 00:09:58.040
makes Sputnik V a viable option

00:09:58.040 --> 00:10:00.250
for developing countries
that are struggling

00:10:00.250 --> 00:10:03.223
to either obtain or
distribute inoculations.

00:10:04.490 --> 00:10:07.000
But there are questions
about how much politics

00:10:07.000 --> 00:10:09.480
will impact the vaccine's distribution.

00:10:09.480 --> 00:10:10.670
We do not do politics.

00:10:10.670 --> 00:10:13.680
And obviously vaccine is
our effort to save people

00:10:13.680 --> 00:10:15.800
and it should not be politicized.

00:10:15.800 --> 00:10:19.610
Russia clearly has been using the vaccine,

00:10:19.610 --> 00:10:23.850
Sputnik V, as a way to
bolster its global ambitions.

00:10:23.850 --> 00:10:26.170
In Latin America for example,

00:10:26.170 --> 00:10:28.730
Argentina has already had deliveries

00:10:28.730 --> 00:10:31.620
of two and a half million doses.

00:10:31.620 --> 00:10:34.740
It's ordered a total of 20 million.

00:10:34.740 --> 00:10:37.990
Mexico is another big buyer they've asked

00:10:37.990 --> 00:10:41.190
for 24 million doses.

00:10:41.190 --> 00:10:45.170
Russia hasn't asked any
countries to pay a premium.

00:10:45.170 --> 00:10:48.728
However, it's not offering any discounts

00:10:48.728 --> 00:10:49.828
for poorer countries.

00:10:49.828 --> 00:10:52.980
So in Latin America or Africa

00:10:52.980 --> 00:10:56.440
the price is the same as anywhere else

00:10:56.440 --> 00:10:59.640
and that's approximately $10 a shot.

00:10:59.640 --> 00:11:02.910
and we know that some
Western manufacturers

00:11:02.910 --> 00:11:07.883
are providing discounts
for developing countries.

00:11:09.200 --> 00:11:11.090
However, Russia's pharma industry,

00:11:11.090 --> 00:11:14.610
wasn't prepared for the level
of demand for Sputnik V.

00:11:14.610 --> 00:11:17.320
The RDIF, Russia's
sovereign wealth fund, who

00:11:17.320 --> 00:11:20.530
were financing the vaccine
had to strike production deals

00:11:20.530 --> 00:11:22.850
around the world to
support the global supply

00:11:22.850 --> 00:11:24.043
for Sputnik V abroad.

00:11:26.670 --> 00:11:29.010
There are definitely
still problems in ramping

00:11:29.010 --> 00:11:30.400
up production.

00:11:30.400 --> 00:11:33.360
Russia's total production of Sputnik V

00:11:33.360 --> 00:11:37.950
since the pandemic started
is less than the number

00:11:37.950 --> 00:11:41.920
of vaccine shots
administered every two weeks

00:11:41.920 --> 00:11:43.430
to the U.S. population.

00:11:43.430 --> 00:11:46.228
It is now promising

00:11:46.228 --> 00:11:49.180
to produce much larger quantities.

00:11:49.180 --> 00:11:52.360
Particularly in India it
has a very ambitious target

00:11:52.360 --> 00:11:56.530
of 700 million two dose sets,

00:11:56.530 --> 00:11:58.790
which it is hoping to get manufactured

00:11:58.790 --> 00:12:00.826
outside Russia this year.

00:12:02.470 --> 00:12:03.430
Closer to home,

00:12:03.430 --> 00:12:06.430
there's been a lack of
enthusiasm for the vaccine.

00:12:06.430 --> 00:12:09.230
With a recent poll revealing that 62%

00:12:09.230 --> 00:12:11.573
of respondents wouldn't take Sputnik V.

00:12:13.280 --> 00:12:16.420
Despite ordering mass
inoculations in January,

00:12:16.420 --> 00:12:19.620
Putin himself didn't get
vaccinated until seven months

00:12:19.620 --> 00:12:21.273
after the August announcement.

00:12:22.160 --> 00:12:25.690
The Kremlin said he was
focusing on other inoculations.

00:12:25.690 --> 00:12:26.890
It was not made public

00:12:26.890 --> 00:12:30.016
which of the Russian vaccines he received.

00:12:30.016 --> 00:12:32.930
In a way that the
traditional Russian mistrust

00:12:32.930 --> 00:12:35.955
of authority has made it easier

00:12:35.955 --> 00:12:38.596
for the government

00:12:38.596 --> 00:12:41.240
because the demand for
the vaccine is not as high

00:12:41.240 --> 00:12:42.860
as it would have been elsewhere.

00:12:42.860 --> 00:12:46.720
In Russia, you can get it if you want it,

00:12:46.720 --> 00:12:48.310
but many just don't want to

00:12:48.310 --> 00:12:51.620
and perhaps even Putin's own slowness

00:12:51.620 --> 00:12:56.008
in getting vaccinated is
indicative of, you know,

00:12:56.008 --> 00:12:59.290
how cautious Russians are
about this whole thing.

00:12:59.290 --> 00:13:01.230
Russia has been hit especially hard

00:13:01.230 --> 00:13:05.690
by the pandemic with at least
250,000 epidemic-linked deaths

00:13:05.690 --> 00:13:07.586
Russian officials said.

00:13:07.586 --> 00:13:08.700
But the country could now

00:13:08.700 --> 00:13:12.610
hold a powerful weapon in
the fight against the virus.

00:13:12.610 --> 00:13:16.640
I think the Sputnik vaccine
will be a very powerful tool.

00:13:16.640 --> 00:13:18.530
I think we still have a few questions

00:13:18.530 --> 00:13:19.610
that need to be answered.

00:13:19.610 --> 00:13:23.060
I still think we want
to see the final data

00:13:23.060 --> 00:13:27.070
at the end of May when the
phase three trial is due to end

00:13:27.070 --> 00:13:29.430
and all of the safety data.

00:13:29.430 --> 00:13:33.980
So yes, a few small bits of
data that I would like to see

00:13:33.980 --> 00:13:37.290
but I think the Sputnik
vaccine will absolutely

00:13:37.290 --> 00:13:42.170
be a very powerful tool in
the global vaccine campaign

00:13:42.170 --> 00:13:45.870
as well as many other
vaccines that are both being

00:13:45.870 --> 00:13:50.130
developed right now, or being
used in other countries.

00:13:50.130 --> 00:13:53.300
We just need to combine
that sort of manufacturing

00:13:53.300 --> 00:13:57.650
and distribution with that
solid clinical evaluation.

00:13:57.650 --> 00:14:00.400
And I think that we are doing that.

00:14:00.400 --> 00:14:03.360
It's made a huge difference
to Russia's image.

00:14:03.360 --> 00:14:07.640
Definitely a very good
tool of soft diplomacy,

00:14:07.640 --> 00:14:11.430
which has shown that Russia
has the capacity to play

00:14:11.430 --> 00:14:14.353
an important role in
combating this pandemic.

